docs {
  # Finance → Billings

  Billing list (`/finance/billings`) with All / OPD / Diagnostics / Radiology /
  IPD / Pharmacy tabs. **No dedicated finance endpoint yet** — the diagnostics
  billing screen under Registration reuses the general `GET /orders` (see
  **42 Orders**); the finance-side list is otherwise frontend-only / mock.
  Placeholder for any finance-specific billing endpoints.
}
